  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Railway Restructuring (PKP) Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project objective is to support implementation of the commercialization, restructuring and partial privatization of Polish State Railways. The project includes temporary income support/severance packages and redeployment services (job search counseling and re-training) for about 37,000 redundant employees to be laid off between August 2000 and December 2002 It also includes technical assistance on implementation of the restructuring and privatization.</narrative>
  </description>
